    ## Visueel proces
    ```mermaid
    flowchart LR
      STOF1(["Meel"])
      STOF2(["Water"])
      STOF3(["Brood"])

      class STOF1,STOF2,STOF3 data;

      classDef data fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
      classDef emission fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;

      EP1(["Schouw 1"])
      EP2(["Lozingspunt 1"])

      class EP1,EP2 emission;

      PROCES1["Deeg maken"]
      PROCES2["Brood bakken"]

      STOF1 --> PROCES1
      STOF2 --> PROCES1
      PROCES1 --> PROCES2
      PROCES1 --> EP2
      PROCES2 --> EP1

      PROCES2 --> STOF3
    ```
    {% endmarkdown %}
  </section>
